{"id":"vod_bf_44448","vodId":"44448","provider":"bf","providerName":"暴风资源","type":2,"name":"在地下城寻求邂逅是否搞错了什么第一季","name_cn":"在地下城寻求邂逅是否搞错了什么第一季","date":"2015-01-01","year":"2015","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"更新至第13集","images":{"common":"https://img.bfzypic.com/upload/vod/20230424-45/d44ed5f3b11987bc73be2102b9bad803.jpg"},"summary":"故事发生在一座名为欧拉丽的繁华都市之中，这座城市的地下有着极其庞大复杂的迷宫，人们称之为“地下城”。某日，少年贝尔（松冈祯丞 配音）遇见了名为赫斯缇雅（水濑祈 配音）的少女，一直想要成为冒险者的少年同一直在寻找眷属的少女，两人一拍即合，结伴展开了精彩绝伦的冒险。贝尔一直相信，在地下城中，他将会邂逅自己命中注定的女主角，于是，这一天，在生死存亡之际，一位名叫艾斯（大西沙织 配音）的冒险者出现在了他的面前，着戏剧性的一刻让贝尔立刻就坠入了爱河。除了贝尔等人，同样活跃在冒险前线的还有拥有超高智商的少女莉莉露卡（内田真礼 配音）、铁匠韦尔夫（细谷佳正 配音）和剑客大和命（赤崎千夏 配音）等人。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2025-04-02 17:56:35","playable":true,"episodeCount":13,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"bfzym3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://p.bvvvvvvvvv1f.com/video/replacexxx0810/20241103LI64LuJDindex.m3u8/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://p.bvvvvvvvvv1f.com/video/replacexxx0810/20241103EwnPKzsRindex.m3u8/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf5.com/video/zaidixiachengxunqiuxiehoushifougaocuoliaoshimediyiji/第03集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf6.com/video/zaidixiachengxunqiuxiehoushifougaocuoliaoshimediyiji/第04集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf6.com/video/zaidixiachengxunqiuxiehoushifougaocuoliaoshimediyiji/第05集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf6.com/video/zaidixiachengxunqiuxiehoushifougaocuoliaoshimediyiji/第06集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://p.bvvvvvvvvv1f.com/video/replacexxx0810/202411037RWNJ6RJindex.m3u8/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://p.bvvvvvvvvv1f.com/video/replacexxx0810/20241103jLslSYoYindex.m3u8/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://p.bvvvvvvvvv1f.com/video/replacexxx0810/202411034fioJWiJindex.m3u8/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://p.bvvvvvvvvv1f.com/video/replacexxx0810/20241103oCZpYzY2index.m3u8/inde